---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Banner Placement">
  <div class="docs-content">
    <h1>Banner Placement</h1>

    <h2>Section Selection</h2>
    <p>Choose where your banner appears on your store:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Homepage</li>
      <li>Collections pages</li>
      <li>Product pages</li>
      <li>Cart page</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> Different page types serve different purposes. Use hero banners on the homepage, product-specific banners on product pages, and promotional banners on the cart page to maximize conversions.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> For global campaigns that target different areas of your store, include the same banner in different sections.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Target Positioning</h2>
    <p>Precisely place your banner using our visual targeting tool. In the Section area:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Select and expand the section where you want to place the banner</li>
      <li>Click the <strong>Target</strong> button</li>
      <ul><li>Your live store will open in the same window</li></ul>
      <li>Hover over different page regions to see the available placement zones</li>
      <li>Click to select desired position</li>
      <ul><li>If you don't like the selection, you can remove it and pick a different position</li></ul>
      <li>Accept the placement to return to settings</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> The targeting tool provides a glimpse of the first draft of the final position. Use the preview button to check the exact look and feel before publishing.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="docs-info">
      <p><strong>Next Step:</strong> After placing your banner, you can configure <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/rules`} class="text-bao-blue-500 hover:text-bao-purple-500 underline">Display Rules</a> to control when your banners appear based on your customer targeting preferences.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Preview Your Placement</h2>
    <p>Use the preview button to see your banner in its actual position on your live website before publishing.</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Expand the Section where you have included the banner</li>
      <li>Click the <strong>Preview</strong> button in the banner settings</li>
      <li>A new tab will open showing your live store with the banner in place</li>
      <li>Review the placement and appearance</li>
      <li>If adjustments are needed, return to the settings to modify the position or design</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Best Practice:</strong> To ensure proper placement across all screen formats, always preview your banner on different window sizes.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4">
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/settings`} class="btn bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300">
        ← Previous: Banner Settings
      </a>
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/rules`} class="btn btn-primary">
        Next: Banner Rules →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
